s test rather than an exhaustive proof of every possible scheduling interleaving; the inspected atomic-rename implementation provides supporting evidence.","The final reader-process count of two is ambiguous because its broad command-line pattern can match the evidence command or its wrapper; the bounded reader jobs were explicitly waited on, publisher process count was zero, and no test temporary artifacts remained."]}
